          "title": "Obfuscated",
          "text": "I found and absorbed all that the local Patriarchy agents know.\n\nThere are many non-human sentients in the world.\n\nGoblins live in the mountains to the east. Giant squid rule the seas.\n\nVampires hide in the cities. Forest spirits dwell in the woods, strange and mute.\n\nBut no whisper of anything like me has ever reached this Trading Post.\n\nAm I all alone?\n\n[i]Permanent Upgrade [color=gold]Obfuscated[/color][/i]  \n+100% to all [icon=trading_post]Trading Post production",
